      "remediation": {
        "description": "PHI/PII ECS task has a task role granting access to services outside the minimum necessary for its declared function. Credential theft via SSRF would expose PHI data paths and cross-service access.",
        "action": "Scope the task role to only the services in the PHI data path. Remove access to services the task does not require. For PHI tasks accessing S3, restrict to specific bucket ARNs. For tasks accessing DynamoDB, restrict to specific table ARNs. Ensure no wildcard resource ARNs exist on data-plane actions.",
